<title>SWEDEN: Swedish airports cargo volumes up 14 pct in 1996.</title>
<headline>Swedish airports cargo volumes up 14 pct in 1996.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-01-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish airports handled 14,759 tonnes of freight in December, a rise of 23 percent over the same month a year ago, Sweden's civil aviation administration Luftfartsverket said.</p>
<p>For calendar 1996 the airport moved 14 percent more freight than in 1995, or a total of 153,551 tonnes, it said.</p>
<p> SWEDISH AIRPORT ACTIVITY		Dec		 Jan-Dec</p>
<p>					  1996     1995	1996    1995</p>
<p> Cargo(in tonnes)		 14,759   12,014   153,551  134,738</p>
<p> Mail (in tonnes)		  2,783    2,652    31,568   27,238</p>
<p> Landings			   22,195   22,218   330,820  322,645</p>
<p> Passengers (in millions)	 1.34     1.24     17.78    16.76</p>
<p>-- Abigail Schmelz, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700-1003</p>
